{
    "2": {
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't you get it? You stance no chance."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're just a Holiday Overlord. You'll die."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I got this, don't mind me!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey!"
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm here now! Show your fatass! I know you're in here!",
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "!?",
                "Who the hell is screaming like that?"
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, it's...!"
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah! It's me!",
                "Come here already!"
            ]
        },
        "194_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Halloween country Overlord...Overlord Alinsky!",
                "No way."
            ]
        },
        "195_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ultimate Makai Overlord",
                "Kuri Taronara"
            ]
        },
        "195_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Did you brought some candy? I really wanted some from there."
            ]
        },
        "196_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why the hell I would bring candy to you?"
            ]
        },
        "198_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, You're from halloween kingdom, Aren't you?"
            ]
        },
        "199_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I assumed you would have candy and all that stuff."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, I don't."
            ]
        },
        "202_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Awwww, Ok then, You can leave."
            ]
        },
        "203_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not going anywhere I'm here to kick your ass!"
            ]
        },
        "204_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You don't have to worry!",
                "Soon, we can all live in the same kingdom!"
            ]
        },
        "205_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah, That's exactly what I don't want."
            ]
        },
        "206_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why?"
            ]
        },
        "207_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Because I'm not sharing a damn kingdom with YOU."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And if I have to I'll just beat any other overlords",
                "Who I have to live with!"
            ]
        },
        "209_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Woah."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I never knew holiday people were big jerks.",
                "(Laughs)"
            ]
        },
        "211_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yes we are, It's pretty much the damn rule you know!"
            ]
        },
        "212_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh well..."
            ]
        },
        "213_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Makai is not different anyways.",
                "Holiday people can still fit in here!"
            ]
        },
        "214_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your mind is still stuck with all that holiday stuff."
            ]
        },
        "215_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's even your damn obsession with them?"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're a hell overlord, you're supposed to be thinking in",
                "Power, domination and all that stuff."
            ]
        },
        "217_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Bahhh, so boring...Plus I already got all that."
            ]
        },
        "218_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So, what else are you supposed to care about?"
            ]
        },
        "219_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I want variety for my eyes! That's what I want!"
            ]
        },
        "220_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Whaaaaat!?",
                "What the hell you mean by that!?"
            ]
        },
        "221_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That makai is starting to get too monotome for me.",
                "Now you get it?"
            ]
        },
        "222_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No, No, I still don't get it."
            ]
        },
        "223_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ugh, It's always the same reddish-creepy nature.",
                "All the time!"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then just re-decorate or something"
            ]
        },
        "225_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Can't you just order that? You're this place overlord!"
            ]
        },
        "226_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You see...",
                "Here in makai, seasons doesn't exist."
            ]
        },
        "227_0": {
            "lines": [
                "We always have this same agonizing nature no matter what."
            ]
        },
        "228_0": {
            "lines": [
                "\"Wow is all red, weird and creepy!\""
            ]
        },
        "229_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Variety is the spice of life after all."
            ]
        },
        "230_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why not visiting the damn holidays for yourself then."
            ]
        },
        "231_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I considered it!"
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But is too boring to fly too much to get in there."
            ]
        },
        "233_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh come on."
            ]
        },
        "234_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're a makai overlord.",
                "you probably got all the energy in a world for that."
            ]
        },
        "235_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Enough talking!",
                "If you're here to complain you can submit or get lost in hell!"
            ]
        },
        "236_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not doing neither."
            ]
        },
        "237_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see",
                "In that case..."
            ]
        },
        "238_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll just destroy your stupid fake moon right here!",
                "I'll take your dark paradise myself! Halloween overlord!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't you get it? You stance no chance."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're just a holiday resident. You'll die."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I just waaaaaanna talk with her! Believe me!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ugh..."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That black hole is really strong in here!"
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yes yes! It really is!"
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Soon Holidays will be mine!"
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What the hell are you saying? Stop talking crap!"
            ]
        },
        "194_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, I'm not talking crap!!"
            ]
        },
        "196_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ultimate Makai Overlord",
                "Kuri Taronara"
            ]
        },
        "195_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's what's actually happening! To my sweet Underworld."
            ]
        },
        "197_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm? What's gonna happen to this place?"
            ]
        },
        "199_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Soon...There'll be more seasons! More variety! Finally!"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're pretty optimistic about sucking up a lot of people",
                "Into hell."
            ]
        },
        "202_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm just tired of This place constant agonizing nature."
            ]
        },
        "203_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah? A Makai overlord tired of Makai? That's new."
            ]
        },
        "204_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Pretty much."
            ]
        },
        "205_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The redish, creepy agonizing athmosphere is tiring!",
                "I want winter, summers, autumns! You get it."
            ]
        },
        "206_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, I have an idea for you."
            ]
        },
        "207_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Talk."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What about just celebrating those holidays in makai?"
            ]
        },
        "209_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh! Damelie suggested that idea before."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That sounds less stupid! Don't you think?"
            ]
        },
        "211_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Holiday people are an important part for holidays.",
                "They're part of its essense."
            ]
        },
        "212_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So you think it'll be easy to get them in here?",
                "Without a black hole?"
            ]
        },
        "213_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ehhhh...No it won't be easy."
            ]
        },
        "214_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I knew it~"
            ]
        },
        "215_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If anything, they'll probably hate you."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't care! They'll all live like makai people."
            ]
        },
        "217_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You'll get even more people to work for you guys?",
                "Hell!"
            ]
        },
        "218_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're truly a makai overlord, I can tell."
            ]
        },
        "219_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heheheheheheh"
            ]
        },
        "220_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Also, Dammy told me about you. A lot.",
                "I can tell because of the pumpkins."
            ]
        },
        "221_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh?"
            ]
        },
        "222_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You guys were talking about me?",
                "I'm flattered."
            ]
        },
        "223_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah we did! You're from halloween country!",
                "Makai loves halloween!"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I guess makai and halloween country are kinda similar."
            ]
        },
        "225_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, both are so creepy and full of monsters!",
                "I guess it makes sense."
            ]
        },
        "226_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's why it's my first target."
            ]
        },
        "227_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Time to submit to makai...Like the rest of you!"
            ]
        },
        "228_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, but I don't feel like it now."
            ]
        },
        "229_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That wasn't a question! Now..."
            ]
        },
        "230_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm still not feeling like submiting to you! you know?",
                "I'll take your country of horror! Miss of horror!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "22": {
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "For a cat, You're very brave."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Unfortunately, You stance no chance with a hell overlord."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Blah blah blah, aren't you tired of talking so much?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey \"Hell's Overlord\""
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm looking for you! Show up!"
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh? In this moment?"
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was looking at how the leprechauns were failling into here."
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just show up!"
            ]
        },
        "194_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Woah! A cat girl!"
            ]
        },
        "195_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ghost Girl in the Netherworld Tower",
                "Yuyuko Saigyouji"
            ]
        },
        "195_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm surprised a Cat managed to get in here!"
            ]
        },
        "196_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh well, I got my ways."
            ]
        },
        "198_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You don't seem from here.",
                "Let me guess, you're from christmas country."
            ]
        },
        "199_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Christmas country!? I'm not from there!"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That kingdom is full of mouses!",
                "They're all squeaky and annoying!"
            ]
        },
        "201_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That sounds fun! I also love mouses."
            ]
        },
        "202_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll also get christmas country after this one...",
                "After dominating halloween country."
            ]
        },
        "203_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Woah woah woah!",
                "What's up with all that sucking up kingdom stuff?"
            ]
        },
        "204_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Come on! Damelie probably already told you."
            ]
        },
        "205_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm tired of makai's constant agonizing creepy nature.",
                "We don't even have seasons."
            ]
        },
        "206_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Soooooooooooooo...."
            ]
        },
        "207_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So...!"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Me and Damelie are opening black holes in holidays.",
                "So we can have holidays and seasons in hell!!"
            ]
        },
        "209_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh yeah That's like totally a good idea!"
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Totally, totally good idea to suck everything into hell."
            ]
        },
        "211_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh! I'm very glad you liked it~"
            ]
        },
        "212_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If a holiday cat liked it then it must be good!",
                "A lot of makai residents also did love it!"
            ]
        },
        "213_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was joking, it sucks ass."
            ]
        },
        "214_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But as you servant said... You're a brat."
            ]
        },
        "215_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You think so?",
                "Damelie would never say something like that."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well he did because you're that! An egocentric stupid brat!"
            ]
        },
        "217_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ok ok, I probably am."
            ]
        },
        "218_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Good. You admitted it."
            ]
        },
        "219_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I wonder if a cat could kick an holiday-obssessed vampire."
            ]
        },
        "220_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A holiday obssessed ultimate makai overlord you meant!"
            ]
        },
        "221_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah yeah I get it you're Ultimate, supreme and all that."
            ]
        },
        "222_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But despite that..."
            ]
        },
        "223_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm still not afraid of you."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh! I see."
            ]
        },
        "225_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A very, very, pretty brave cat."
            ]
        },
        "226_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Defying the overlord of the world of eternal horror!",
                "Who's about to takeover her country!"
            ]
        },
        "227_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Okok I got it."
            ]
        },
        "228_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh yeah, After all..."
            ]
        },
        "229_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What? You're just some stupid hell brat?",
                "you're just a grumpy cat...complaining about this and that."
            ]
        }
    }
}